Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 05:00:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: knowledgeBaseStatus lifecycle + n8n callback endpoint
 (Step 3)

- Set status to 'scraping' immediately on register (not inside .then())
- On n8n webhook failure, set status to 'failed' so frontend doesn't spin
- Add POST /api/business/kb-status: n8n calls this when scraping finishes
  - Protected by x-n8n-secret header (N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET env var)
  - Accepts status 'ready'|'failed'|'scraping' + optional chunk count
- Add GET /api/business/kb-progress/:businessId: frontend polls this for
  live progress (status + chunk count)
- Add kbChunkCount field to Business model
- Document N8N_CALLBACK_SECRET in server/env.example
---
 server/controller/businessController.js | 69 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 server/env.example                      |  2 +
 server/models/Business.js               |  5 ++
 server/routes/businessRoute.js          |  8 +++
 4 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/server/controller/businessController.js b/server/controller/businessController.js
index 5383ed5..5a20a34 100644
